{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂出たよよよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さむい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべるけど雪の上を\n歩きたいのよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャリシャリの音すきなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝はゆーっくりゆーっくり\n学校に行ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転ばなかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手する時どんな話したい？(^-^)\nてかむしろまりかのとこ\n握手行った方がいい？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなって...なんでも！\n他愛ない話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え！てか来てくれないの？！\n来てよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼くこだわりってどんなの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半生でもいいのと、\nしっかり火が通ってないと\nだめなのとかあるからね。\nだって、おなかこわしたらって\n思ったら怖いでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まじめすぎたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってみなみがすぐ\nひっくり返すんだもん笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはできるっていう楽器ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落のこだわりは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなもの着る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振袖を着るなら何色？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十歳になったら決めたいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ちゃんはメンバーや\nファンの変化に気付く方ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近みなみが前髪切ったのを\nメンバーいちばん最初に\n気づいてあげた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...くらいですかね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにぎりの具で何が1番好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅！！！\n贅沢にいくならいくら！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お鍋が美味しい季節ですが、\nまりっかが一番好きな鍋は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豚バラと白菜のミルフィーユ鍋\n豆乳鍋、レタしゃぶ鍋、キムチ鍋..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鍋はいいですね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼じゃーん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvでニコルさんと描いた絵だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この絵、結局どこに\n行っちゃったのかしら..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/4656452/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}